ule'=>'添加新规则','Add new slide'=>'添加新幻灯片','Add new wishlist'=>'添加新愿望清单','Add popup'=>'添加弹出窗口','Add posts, pages, etc. by title.'=>'按标题添加文章、页面等。','Add product 360 view gallery images'=>'添加产品360度视图图库图片','Add products by title.'=>'按标题添加产品。','Add projects in the query.'=>'在查询中添加项目。','Add rule'=>'添加规则','Add shadow'=>'添加阴影','Add shadow to product summary block'=>'为产品摘要块添加阴影','Add shadow to the header section.'=>'为页眉部分添加阴影。','Add sidebar'=>'添加侧边栏','Add slide'=>'添加幻灯片','Add spaces between photos'=>'在照片之间添加空格','Add synonyms to search queries to broaden the products search results. Format: ”key = value 1, value 2”. Each group of synonyms starts on a new line. For example, if you add “shirt = polo, jersey” to the synonym list, a search for “shirt” will automatically be converted into a search that matches products containing either “shirt”, ”polo” or ”jersey”. Synonyms are one-way. If you need both directions, add the synonym in reverse: “jersey = shirt”.'=>'在搜索查询中添加同义词，以扩大产品搜索结果范围。格式为：“key = value 1, value 2”。每组同义词均应独占一行。 例如，如果您将“shirt = polo, jersey”添加到同义词列表中，搜索“shirt”时，系统会自动将该搜索转换为匹配包含“shirt”、“polo”或“jersey”任一词的产品。 同义词是单向的。如果您需要双向匹配，请将同义词按相反顺序添加： “jersey = shirt”。','Add tab in tabs area'=>'在标签页区域添加标签页','Add the ability to view the product gallery on the products loop.'=>'在产品循环中添加查看产品图库的功能。','Add the product to wishlist'=>'将该商品添加到愿望清单','Add this product to compare'=>'将此商品加入对比清单','Add to cart'=>'加入购物车','Add to cart
