','Chess'=>'国际象棋','Child categories'=>'子类别','Child product categories'=>'子产品类别','Child theme'=>'子主题','Choose'=>'选择','Choose "Individual variation" to have variations of a variable product count as an individual product.'=>'选择“单独变体”，将可变产品的不同变体视为单独的产品。','Choose a color'=>'选择一种颜色','Choose a type for the pagination on your blog page.'=>'为您的博客页面选择一种分页类型。','Choose a type for the pagination on your portfolio page.'=>'为您的作品集页面选择一种分页类型。','Choose a type for the pagination on your shop page.'=>'请为您的店铺页面选择一种分页类型。','Choose ascending or descending order.'=>'选择升序或降序。','Choose attribute that will be shown on products grid for this particular product'=>'为该特定商品选择将在商品列表中显示的属性','Choose between different predefined designs'=>'从不同的预设设计中进行选择','Choose between different predefined designs.'=>'从不同的预设设计中进行选择。','Choose between horizontal and vertical layouts for the quick view window.'=>'为“快速查看”窗口选择横向或纵向布局。','Choose between showing an informative popup and opening the shopping cart widget.'=>'可在显示信息提示框和打开购物车小工具之间进行选择。','Choose how the video will fill its container.'=>'选择视频在容器中的填充方式。','Choose how to display delivery time: as specific dates or as number of days.'=>'选择配送时间的显示方式：以具体日期还是以天数显示。','Choose how to display the price of gift products, either as "Free" or "$0.00".'=>'请选择礼品的价格显示方式，可选“免费”或“$0.00”。','Choose HTML block (experimental)'=>'选择 HTML 块（实验性功能）','Choose Image'=>'选择图片','Choose image'=>'选择图片','Choose Menu'=>'选择菜单','Choose menu'=>'选择菜单','Choose on which categories pages you want to display this filter. Or leave empty to show on all pages.'=>'请选择要在哪些分类页面上显示此筛选器。或留空以在所有页面上显示。','Choose one of the blog designs available in the theme.'=>'从主题中提供的博客样式中选择一种。','Choose one of the designs available in the theme.'=>'请从该主题中可用的设计中选择一种。','Choose one of the following swatch type:'=>'请从以下色板类型中选择一种：','Choose one of those designs for categories'=>'请从这些设计中选择一款作为分类样式','Choose one of those predefined product layouts for grid.'=>'从这些预设的产品网格布局中选择一个。','Choose one of those predefined product layouts for products'=>'为产品选择其中一种预定义的产品布局','Choose page that will contain detailed information about your Privacy Policy'=>'请选择将包含您的《隐私政策》详细信息的页面','Choose Sidebar'=>'选择侧边栏','Choose style of the product\'s review.'=>'选择产品评论的样式。','Choose the attribute that will be shown on the product grid.'=>'选择要在商品列表中显示的属性。','Choose the close button design.'=>'选择“关闭”按钮的设计。','Choose the default display for the waitlist feature: either show the form for joining the waitlist or display the current status (joined or not).'=>'选择候补名单功能的默认显示方式：显示加入候补名单的表单，或显示当前状态（已加入或未加入）。','Choose the method for applying gift rules: either automatically add the gift to the cart or display it in a table for manual addition by the customer.'=>'选择应用礼品规则的方式：是将礼品自动添加到购物车，还是以表格形式显示供顾客手动添加。','Choose the page you want to add to your menu.'=>'选择您想要添加到菜单中的页面。','Choose the type of adding product variation to the cart on the product grid.'=>'在商品列表中选择将商品变体添加到购物车的类型。','Choose video'=>'选择视频','Choose whether your image is added to the page using an "img" tag or as a background via CSS. Selecting the correct placement type will help determine whether srcsets are used for the image, ensuring each of them is considered in the LCP option. If you set the image using "Find" function, this value will be selected automatically.'=>'请选择是通过“img”标签将图片添加到页面，还是通过CSS将其设置为背景。选择正确的放置类型将有助于确定是否为该图片使用srcsets，从而确保在LCP选项中考虑所有srcsets。如果您使用“查找”功能设置图片，该值将自动选中。','Choose which buttons will be used for sticky navbar.'=>'选择要用于固定导航栏的按钮。','Choose which coupon code to send.'=>'选择要发送的优惠码。','Choose which fields should be presented on the product compare page with table.'=>'选择应在带表格的产品对比页面上显示哪些字段。','Choose which HTML block to display in the header'=>'选择要在页眉中显示的 HTML 代码块','Choose which HTML tag to use for the page title.'=>'请选择用于页面标题的 HTML 标签。','Choose which HTML tag to use in widget title.'=>'选择要在小工具标题中使用的 HTML 标签。','Choose which layout you want to use as a base for your new header.'=>'选择您希望作为新页眉基础的布局。','Choose which menu to display in the header as a categories dropdown.'=>'选择要在页眉中作为分类下拉菜单显示的菜单。','Choose which menu to display in the header.'=>'选择要在页眉中显示哪个菜单。','Choose which menu to display.'=>'选择要显示的菜单。','Choose which type of email to send.'=>'选择要发送的电子邮件类型。','Choose your footer color scheme'=>'选择页脚配色方案','Choose your footer layout. Depending on the number of the columns you will have a different number of widget areas for the footer in Appearance->Widgets.'=>'选择页脚布局。根据列数的多少，在“外观”→“小工具”中，页脚的小工具区域数量也会有所不同。','Choose your form border width'=>'选择表单边框宽度','Choose your form style'=>'选择表单样式','Choose your gift'=>'选择您的礼物' . "\0" . '','Choose your mobile logo from the Media Library or upload one from your device.'=>'从媒体库中选择您的手机徽标，或从设备中上传一个。','Circle'=>'圆','Classic'=>'经典','Clean actions'=>'清洁操作','Clear'=>'清除','Clear all'=>'清除全部','Clear button'=>'“清除”按钮','Clear button position'=>'“清除”按钮的位置','Clear filters'=>'清除筛选条件','Clear search'=>'清除搜索','Clear search button'=>'清除搜索按钮','Clear variation'=>'明显变异','Click'=>'点击','Click "Edit" to modify an existing menu, or click "Use new menu" to create one from scratch.'=>'点击“编辑”可修改现有菜单，或点击“使用新菜单”从头创建一个菜单。','Click "Save header" to apply and save all changes made to the current header.'=>'点击“保存页眉”以应用并保存对当前页眉所做的所有更改。','Click action'=>'点击操作','Click on "Menus" in the dropdown that appears.'=>'在弹出的下拉菜单中点击“菜单”。','Click on the "Edit with Elementor" button to launch the Elementor page builder and start editing the content of your page with its powerful tools.'=>'点击“使用 Elementor 编辑”按钮，即可启动 Elementor 页面构建器，并利用其强大的工具开始编辑页面内容。','Click on the "Manage Locations" tab at the top of the Menus screen.'=>'点击“菜单”屏幕顶部的“管理位置”选项卡。','Click on the "Section title" element to select the heading section you want to edit.'=>'点击“章节标题”元素，选择您要编辑的标题章节。','Click on the "Settings" icon in the top right corner of the editor to open the sidebar panel. This panel contains various settings for the selected block.'=>'点击编辑器右上角的“设置”图标，即可打开侧边栏面板。该面板包含所选区块的各项设置。','Click on the "Typography" menu item to open font customization options.'=>'点击“排版”菜单项，即可打开字体自定义选项。','Click on the "WPBakery Page Builder" button to launch the WPBakery page builder and start editing the content of your page with its powerful tools.'=>'点击“WPBakery 页面构建器”按钮，启动 WPBakery 页面构建器，并利用其强大的工具开始编辑页面内容。','Click on the Theme settings menu item in the main menu of the admin panel.'=>'在管理面板的主菜单中，点击“主题设置”菜单项。','Click on the title block on the page. This is typically a heading block that displays the main title of the section or page.'=>'点击页面上的标题块。这通常是一个显示该章节或页面主标题的标题块。','Click the "Create menu" button to save your new menu. You’ll now be able to add menu items and assign it to a location.'=>'点击“创建菜单”按钮以保存您的新菜单。现在，您可以添加菜单项并将其分配到相应位置。','Click the "Edit page" button in the top admin bar to open the homepage in the block editor.'=>'点击顶部管理栏中的“编辑页面”按钮，即可在块编辑器中打开首页。','Click the "Edit page" button in the top admin bar to open the homepage in the Elementor editor.'=>'点击顶部管理栏中的“编辑页面”按钮，即可在 Elementor 编辑器中打开首页。','Click the "Edit page" button in the top admin bar to open the homepage in the WPBakery editor.'=>'点击顶部管理栏中的“编辑页面”按钮，即可在 WPBakery 编辑器中打开首页。','Click the "Frontend Editor" button to enable live visual editing of your header.'=>'点击“前端编辑器”按钮，即可对页眉进行实时可视化编辑。','Click the "Mobile" button in the Header Builder to view and edit the mobile version of your header.'=>'点击“移动端”按钮，即可查看和编辑页眉的移动端版本。','Click the "Save menu" button to apply all your changes and make the menu active on your site.'=>'点击“保存菜单”按钮，以应用所有更改并使该菜单在您的网站上生效。','Click the "Save" button to apply all changes made in the Theme settings panel.'=>'点击“保存”按钮，即可应用“主题设置”面板中进行的所有更改。','Click the "Update" button to save all changes made to the page.'=>'点击“更新”按钮，以保存对该页面所做的所有更改。','Click the arrow on the newly added menu item to expand its settings.'=>'点击新添加的菜单项上的箭头，以展开其设置。','Click the Header Builder icon in the top bar of the admin panel.'=>'点击管理面板顶部工具栏中的“页眉设计器”图标。','Click the link below to grab it before it\'s gone!'=>'点击下面的链接，趁还没下架赶紧抢购吧！','Click the link below to grab it before it\'s gone!
