g they are among the first to know and can make a purchase promptly.'=>'设置邮件通知功能，当客户关注的产品有货时向其发送通知，确保他们能第一时间获知消息并及时下单。','Configure your [social_buttons] shortcode. You can leave the field empty to remove a particular link. Note that there are two types of social buttons. First one is SHARE buttons [social_buttons type="share"]. It displays icons that share your page on social media. And the second one is FOLLOW buttons [social_buttons type="follow"]. Simply displays links to your social profiles. You can configure both types here.'=>'配置您的 [social_buttons] 短代码。您可以将该字段留空以移除特定链接。请注意，社交按钮分为两种类型。第一种是“分享”按钮 [social_buttons type="share"]，它会显示用于在社交媒体上分享您页面的图标。 第二种是“关注”按钮 [social_buttons type="follow"]，仅显示指向您社交个人主页的链接。您可以在此处配置这两种类型的按钮。','Confirm'=>'确认','Confirm now'=>'立即确认','Confirm waitlist subscription'=>'确认候补名单订阅','Confirmed'=>'已确认','Congratulations! You have successfully installed our theme and are ready to start building your amazing website! With our theme, you have full control over the layout and style, giving you the flexibility to create a site that suits your vision perfectly.'=>'恭喜！您已成功安装我们的主题，现在可以开始打造您令人惊叹的网站了！借助我们的主题，您可以完全掌控布局和风格，灵活地创建一个完全符合您设想的网站。','Congratulations! You’ve successfully replaced the default logo with your own. Click the "Done" button to finish.'=>'恭喜！您已成功将默认徽标替换为您自己的徽标。点击“完成”按钮即可结束操作。','Connect'=>'连接','Connect instagram account'=>'连接 Instagram 账号','Cons'=>'缺点','Cons:'=>'缺点：','Consumer Key'=>'消费者密钥','Consumer Key:'=>'消费者密钥：','Consumer Secret'=>'《消费者秘闻》','Consumer Secret:'=>'消费秘诀：','Contact Form'=>'联系表单','Contact form 7'=>'联系表单 7','Contact forms'=>'联系表单','Contain'=>'包含','Container'=>'容器','Container stretch'=>'集装箱拉伸','Content'=>'内容','Content align'=>'内容对齐','Content alignment'=>'内容对齐','Content background'=>'内容背景','Content background color'=>'内容背景色','Content column'=>'内容栏目','Content full width'=>'全宽内容','Content height'=>'内容高度','Content horizontal alignment'=>'内容的水平对齐','Content of the post'=>'帖子内容','Content on the map horizontal position'=>'地图上内容的水平位