ge'=>'显示 JPG、PNG 或 SVG 图片','Display login form dropdown on hover when user is not logged in.'=>'当用户未登录时，鼠标悬停在登录表单上时显示下拉菜单。','Display mode'=>'显示模式','Display post excerpt'=>'显示文章摘要','Display post title'=>'显示帖子标题','Display pre-built HTML block'=>'显示预构建的 HTML 块','Display project title instead of portfolio page title in page heading'=>'在页面标题中显示项目标题，而不是作品集页面的标题','Display published date'=>'显示发布日期','Display results from blog'=>'显示博客中的结果','Display search icon/form in the header in different views.'=>'在不同视图中，在页眉处显示搜索图标/表单。','Display share buttons icons on the single product page.'=>'在单个商品页面上显示分享按钮图标。','Display share icons on single post page'=>'在单篇文章页面上显示分享图标','Display Size'=>'显示屏尺寸','Display size guide table anywhere'=>'在任意位置显示尺寸参考表','Display stars rating'=>'显示星级评分','Display the filters button fixed on the screen for mobile and tablet devices.'=>'在移动设备和平板电脑上，将“筛选条件”按钮固定在屏幕上。','Display Thumbnail'=>'显示缩略图','Display widget'=>'显示小部件','Display wishlist product button on all products grids and lists.'=>'在所有商品网格和列表中显示“加入心愿单”按钮。','Displayed subtotal'=>'显示的小计','Displays a full chain of links to the current page.'=>'显示指向当前页面的完整链接链。','Displays sales count for a product over a specified time frame, e.g., "3 minutes".'=>'显示某产品在指定时间段内的销售数量，例如“3分钟”。','Displays the most recent posts from your X (Twitter) Stream.'=>'显示您 X（Twitter）时间线上的最新帖子。','Displays the selected variation image based on the chosen filter instead of the default product image.'=>'根据所选筛选条件显示相应的变体图片，而不是默认的产品图片。','div'=>'div','Divider'=>'分隔符','Divider for sections'=>'分区分隔线','Do you really want to remove these products?'=>'您真的要删除这些产品吗？','Documentation'=>'文档','dom size'=>'域大小','DOMDocument'=>'DOMDocument','Don\'t display categories that don\'t have any products assigned.'=>'不要显示未分配任何产品的分类。','Don\'t Forget to Complete Your Purchase!'=>'别忘了完成购买！','Don\'t show duplicated titles for product tabs.'=>'不要在产品标签页中显示重复的标题。','Don\'t use'=>'请勿使用','Done'=>'完成','Done! The desktop logo has been successfully uploaded. Click "Save" to continue.'=