=>'启用主题内置的比较功能。更多信息请参阅我们的 <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs/woodmart/woodmart-compare/">文档</a>。','Enable coupon'=>'启用优惠券','Enable custom slider'=>'启用自定义滑块','Enable description tab'=>'启用“描述”选项卡','Enable desired price'=>'启用目标价格','Enable FAQ Scheme'=>'启用常见问题解答方案','Enable fragments updating'=>'启用片段更新','Enable icons'=>'启用图标','Enable instant AJAX search functionality for this form.'=>'为该表单启用即时 AJAX 搜索功能。','Enable it if you are redirected to my account page without signing in after click on the social login button.'=>'如果您点击社交登录按钮后，在未登录的情况下被重定向到“我的账户”页面，请启用此功能。','Enable it to load translations from all possible locations. Usually needs to be disabled so the translation will be loaded from the system folder only wp-content/languages/themes and the performance will be better.'=>'启用此选项可从所有可能的位置加载翻译。通常需要将其禁用，这样翻译将仅从系统文件夹 wp-content/languages/themes 加载，从而提升性能。','Enable it to show each variation as a separate product on the shop page. You need to resave variable products to make this option work. You can do this separately or using the bulk edit function. Read more information in our <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs-topic/show-single-variation/" target="_blank">documentation</a>.'=>'启用此功能后，商店页面上将把每种变体作为独立商品显示。 您需要重新保存可变商品，才能使此选项生效。您可以单独操作，也可以使用批量编辑功能。更多信息请参阅我们的<a href="https://xtemos.com/docs-topic/show-single-variation/" target="_blank">文档</a>。','Enable lazy loading for images for this element.'=>'为该元素的图片启用延迟加载。','Enable linked variations'=>'启用关联变体','Enable login with Facebook on your web-site.
				To do that you need to create an APP on the Facebook <a href="https://developers.facebook.com/" target="_blank">https://developers.facebook.com/</a>.
				Then go to APP settings and copy App ID and App Secret there. You also need to insert Redirect URI like this example <strong>{{PERMALINK}}facebook/int_callback</strong> More information you can get in our <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs/woodmart/faq-guides/configure-facebook-login/" target="_blank">documentation</a>.'=>'在您的网站上启用通过 Facebook 登录的功能。
为此，您需要在 Facebook 的 <a href="https://developers.facebook.com/" target="_blank">https://developers.facebook.com/</a> 上创建一个应用。
				然后进入应用设置，复制其中的应用 ID 和应用密钥。你还需要按照以下示例填写重定向 URI：<strong>{{PERMALINK}}facebook/int_callback</strong> 更多信息请参阅我们的 <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs/woodmart/faq-guides/configure-facebook-login/" target="_blank">文档</a>中获取更多信息。','Enable maintenance mode'=>'启用维护模式','Enable multiple wishlists'=>'启用多个愿望清单','Enable page scrolling'=>'启用页面滚动','Enable parallax on mouse scroll'=>'启用鼠标滚动时的视差效果','Enable preloader animation while loading your website content. Useful when you move all the CSS to the footer.'=>'在加载网站内容时启用预加载动画。当将所有 CSS 移至页脚时，此功能非常有用。','Enable privacy policy checkbox'=>'启用隐私政策复选框','Enable product count'=>'启用产品数量统计','Enable promo popup'=>'启用促销弹窗','Enable Quick view option for variable products. Will allow your users to purchase variable products directly from the quick view.'=>'为可变商品启用“快速查看”选项。这将允许您的用户直接从“快速查看”页面购买可变商品。','Enable Quick view option. Ability to see the product information with AJAX.'=>'启用“快速查看”选项。支持通过AJAX查看产品信息。','Enable reviews tab'=>'启用“评论”选项卡','Enable scroll'=>'启用滚动功能','Enable shop filters widget\'s area above the products.'=>'在商品上方启用“商店筛选器”小工具区域。','Enable short description'=>'启用简短描述','Enable size guides'=>'启用尺寸参考线','Enable sticky column'=>'启用固定列','Enable sticky navbar'=>'启用固定导航栏','Enable stock status'=>'启用库存状态','Enable tabs for login and register forms'=>'为登录和注册表单启用标签页','Enable the ability for customers to review the product according to several criteria. For example: "Value for money", "Durability", "Delivery speed", etc.'=>'允许客户根据多项标准对产品进行评价。例如：“性价比”、“耐用性”、“配送速度”等。','Enable the ability to add videos to the main product gallery carousel.'=>'启用向主产品图库轮播图中添加视频的功能。','Enable the ability to bulk move or remove products in the wishlist.'=>'启用在“心愿单”中批量移动或删除商品的功能。','Enable the ability to go to the product page from the order table at checkout.'=>'启用从结账时的订单列表跳转至商品页面的功能。','Enable this email notification'=>'启用此电子邮件通知','Enable this option and all brand links will work inside the current category page. Or it will lead to the shop page if you are not on the category page.'=>'启用此选项后，当前分类页面内的所有品牌链接均可正常使用。若您当前不在分类页面中，则这些链接将跳转至商店页面。','Enable this option if you are using a full page cache like WP Rocket.'=>'如果您正在使用 WP Rocket 这样的全页面缓存插件，请启用此选项。','Enable this option if you see this warning in Google Pagespeed report.'=>'如果在 Google Pagespeed 报告中看到此警告，请启用此选项。','Enable this option if you use full-page cache like WP Rocket.'=>'如果您使用的是 WP Rocket 这样的全页面缓存插件，请启用此选项。','Enable this option if you want to change the page number in the URL when you click on the “Load more” button.'=>'如果您希望在点击“加载更多”按钮时更改 URL 中的页码，请启用此选项。','Enable this option if you want to remove the predefined "Price filter" widget from the shop page filters aria.'=>'如果您想从商店页面的筛选器区域中移除预设的“价格筛选”小部件，请启用此选项。','Enable this option if you want to remove the predefined "Sort by" widget from the shop page filters aria.'=>'如果您想从商店页面的筛选器区域中移除预设的“按...排序”小部件，请启用此选项。','Enable this option if you would like to display this element above other elements on the page. You can specify a custom value as well.'=>'如果您希望将此元素显示在页面上其他元素的上方，请启用此选项。您还可以指定自定义值。','Enable this option instead of native Elementor\'s one to stretch section with CSS and not with JS.'=>'启用此选项，而非 Elementor 的原生选项，以便通过 CSS 而不是 JS 拉伸版块。','Enable this option instead of native WPBakery one to stretch row with CSS and not with JS.'=>'启用此选项，而非 WPBakery 的原生选项，以便通过 CSS 而不是 JS 拉伸行。','Enable this option instead of native WPBakery one to stretch section with CSS and not with JS.'=>'启用此选项，而非 WPBakery 的原生选项，以便通过 CSS 而不是 JS 来拉伸版块。','Enable this option to allow customers to subscribe for price drop notifications on products.'=>'启用此选项，允许客户订阅商品降价通知。','Enable this option to allow users customize the bundle and check/uncheck some products.'=>'启用此选项，允许用户自定义套餐并勾选/取消勾选某些产品。','Enable this option to automatically send review reminder emails to customers after they make a purchase.'=>'启用此选项，系统将在客户完成购买后自动向其发送评价提醒邮件。','Enable this option to ensure that the estimated delivery date is correctly updated when caching is enabled.'=>'启用此选项，以确保在启用缓存时，预计送达日期能被正确更新。','Enable this option to make your product have "New" status forever.'=>'启用此选项，可使您的产品永久保持“新品”状态。','Enable this option to optimize your images loading on the website. They will be loaded only when user will scroll the page.'=>'启用此选项可优化网站上的图片加载效果。只有当用户滚动页面时，图片才会加载。','Enable this option to show an attribute label on the product image.'=>'启用此选项可在产品图片上显示属性标签。','Enable this option to stretch container with CSS.'=>'启用此选项可使用 CSS 拉伸容器。','Enable this option when you place this button inside the container with the "Collapsible content" option turned on.'=>'当您将此按钮放置在启用了“可折叠内容”选项的容器内时，请启用此选项。','Enable this to use one page navigation menu. If enabled you need to set the link for this item to be like this: http://your_site.com/home_page/#anchor_id where anchor_id will be the ID of the ROW on your home page.'=>'启用此选项可使用单页导航菜单。启用后，您需要将此项目的链接设置为如下格式：http://your_site.com/home_page/#anchor_id，其中 anchor_id 即为您首页上该 ROW 的 ID。','Enable title'=>'启用标题','Enable to show your menu in full screen style on burger icon click.'=>'启用此功能后，点击汉堡图标即可以全屏模式显示菜单。','Enable wishlist'=>'启用愿望清单','Enable wishlist functionality built in with the theme. Read more information in our <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs/woodmart/woodmart-wishlist/">documentation</a>.'=>'启用主题内置的愿望清单功能。更多信息请参阅我们的 <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs/woodmart/woodmart-wishlist/">文档</a>。','Enable/Disable'=>'启用/禁用','Enable/disable portfolio on your website.'=>'在您的网站上启用/禁用作品集。','Enable/disable short description text in the product\'s summary block.'=>'在产品摘要区块中启用/禁用简短描述文本。','Enable/disable the footer on your website.'=>'启用/禁用网站底部的页脚。','Enable/disable zoom option or switch to photoswipe popup.'=>'启用/禁用缩放选项，或切换至“photoswipe”弹出窗口。','Enabled'=>'已启用','Enables a custom post type for adding labels to products. You can find it under Dashboard → Products → Custom Labels.'=>'启用一个自定义文章类型，用于为产品添加标签。您可以在“仪表盘”→“产品”→“自定义标签”下找到该功能。','Enables a custom post type for adding tabs to single product pages. You can find it under Dashboard → Products → Custom Tabs.'=>'启用一个自定义文章类型，用于在单个产品页面上添加标签页。您可以在“仪表盘”→“产品”→“自定义标签页”下找到它。','Enables autoplay mode.'=>'启用自动播放模式。','Enables lazy loading for background images in Gutenberg blocks, improving performance by loading images only when they enter the viewport.'=>'为古腾堡区块中的背景图片启用延迟加载功能，仅在图片进入视口时才进行加载，从而提升性能。','Enables loop mode.'=>'启用循环模式。','Enables three optional product tabs on single product pages, which can be filled with plain text or HTML-blocks. Leave the field empty to disable the tab.'=>'在单个产品页面上启用三个可选的产品标签页，其中可填写纯文本或HTML代码块。若要禁用该标签页，请将该字段留空。','End'=>'结束','Endpoint for the "My account &rarr; Price tracker" page.'=>'“我的账户 → 价格追踪器”页面的端点。','Endpoint for the "My account &rarr; Waitlist" page.'=>'“我的账户 → 候补名单”页面的端点。','Enter categories, tags or custom taxonomies.'=>'输入分类、标签或自定义分类法。','Enter divider height (Note: CSS measurement units allowed).'=>'输入分隔线高度（注意：允许使用 CSS 长度单位）。','Enter floating block name'=>'输入浮动块名称','Enter image resolution. Example: \'thumbnail\', \'medium\', \'large\', \'full\' or other sizes defined by current theme. Alternatively enter image size in pixels: 200x100 (Width x Height). Leave empty to use \'full\' size.'=>'请输入图片分辨率。示例：“thumbnail”、“medium”、“large”、“full”或当前主题定义的其他尺寸。或者，以像素为单位输入图片尺寸：200x100（宽度 x 高度）。留空即使用“full”尺寸。','Enter image resolution. Example: \'thumbnail\', \'medium\', \'large\', \'full\' or other sizes defined by current theme. Alternatively enter image size in pixels: 200x100 (Width x Height). Leave empty to use \'thumbnail\' size.'=>'请输入图片分辨率。示例：“thumbnail”、“medium”、“large”、“full”或当前主题定义的其他尺寸。或者，以像素为单位输入图片尺寸：200x100（宽度 x 高度）。若留空，则使用“thumbnail”尺寸。','Enter image resolution. Example: \'thumbnail\', \'medium\', \'large\', \'full\' or other sizes defined by current theme. Alternatively enter image size in pixels: 200x50 (Width x Height). Leave empty to use \'thumbnail\' size.'=>'请输入图片分辨率。示例：“thumbnail”、“medium”、“large”、“full”或当前主题定义的其他尺寸。或者，以像素为单位输入图片尺寸：200x50（宽度 x 高度）。留空即使用“thumbnail”尺寸。','Enter image resolution. Example: \'thumbnail\', \'medium\', \'large\', \'full\'. Leave empty to use \'medium\' size.'=>'请输入图片分辨率。示例：\'thumbnail\'、\'medium\'、\'large\'、\'full\'。若留空，则默认使用“medium”尺寸。','Enter image resolution. Example: \'thumbnail\', \'medium\', \'large\', \'full\'. Leave empty to use \'thumbnail\' size.'=>'请输入图片分辨率。示例：\'thumbnail\'、\'medium\'、\'large\'、\'full\'。若留空，则使用“thumbnail”尺寸。','Enter image size. Example: \'thumbnail\', \'medium\', \'large\', \'full\' or other sizes defined by current theme. Alternatively enter image size in pixels: 200x100 (Width x Height). Leave empty to use \'20x20\' size.'=>'请输入图片尺寸。示例：“thumbnail”、“medium”、“large”、“full”或当前主题定义的其他尺寸。或者，以像素为单位输入图片尺寸：200x100（宽度 x 高度）。留空即使用“20x20”尺寸。','Enter image size. Example: \'thumbnail\', \'medium\', \'large\', \'full\' or other sizes defined by current theme. Alternatively enter image size in pixels: 200x100 (Width x Height). Leave empty to use \'thumbnail\' size.'=>'请输入图片尺寸。示例：“thumbnail”、“medium”、“large”、“full”或当前主题定义的其他尺寸。或者，以像素为单位输入图片尺寸：200x100（宽度 x 高度）。若留空，则使用“thumbnail”尺寸。','Enter label name'=>'输入标签名称','Enter layout name'=>'输入版式名称','Enter links for each slide (Note: divide links with linebreaks (Enter)).'=>'请输入每张幻灯片的链接（注意：用换行符（Enter）分隔链接）。','Enter links for each slide (Note: divide links with linebreaks (Enter).'=>'请输入每张幻灯片的链接（注意：用换行符（Enter）分隔链接）。','Enter menu name'=>'输入菜单名称','Enter popup name'=>'输入弹出窗口名称','Enter the class name of the icon. For example "entypo-icon entypo-icon-check".'=>'请输入图标的类名。例如“entypo-icon entypo-icon-check”。','Enter the class name of the icon. For example "fas fa-check".'=>'请输入图标的类名。例如“fas fa-check”。','Enter the class name of the icon. For example "oi oi-check".'=>'请输入图标的类名。例如“oi oi-check”。','Enter the class name of the icon. For example "typcn typcn-input-checked".'=>'请输入图标的类名。例如“typcn typcn-input-checked”。','Enter the class name of the icon. For example "vc-material vc-material-check".'=>'请输入图标的类名。例如“vc-material vc-material-check”。','Enter the class name of the icon. For example "vc-mono vc-mono-addme".'=>'请输入图标的类名。例如“vc-mono vc-mono-addme”。','Enter the class name of the icon. For example "vc_li vc_li-star".'=>'请输入图标的类名。例如“vc_li vc_li-star”。','Enter the number of brands to display for this element.'=>'请输入此元素要显示的品牌数量。','Enter the number of categories to display for this element.'=>'输入要为此元素显示的类别数量。','Enter the person’s name.'=>'请输入该人的姓名。','Enter the person’s title or job position. For example: CEO or Senior Developer.'=>'请输入该人员的头衔或职位。例如：首席执行官或高级开发工程师。','Enter the text that will be displayed as a hint on the additional information table.'=>'请输入将在“附加信息”表格中作为提示显示的文本。','Enter URL if you want this banner to have a link.'=>'如果希望此横幅包含链接，请输入网址。','Enter URL if you want this box to have a link.'=>'如果希望此文本框包含链接，请输入网址。','Enter URL if you want this image to have a link.'=>'如果希望此图片带有链接，请输入网址。','Enter URL if you want this parent menu item to have a link.'=>'如果希望此父级菜单项包含链接，请输入网址。','Enter your'=>'请输入您的','Enter your email address'=>'请输入您的电子邮箱地址','Enter your Instagram username. For example: asos'=>'请输入您的 Instagram 用户名。例如：asos','Enter your name with letters and spacing only. It will be used in a list of fonts under the Typography section. For example: Indie Flower'=>'请仅使用字母和空格输入您的姓名。该姓名将用于“排版”部分下的字体列表中。例如：Indie Flower','Enter your URL'=>'请输入您的网址','Entities names font'=>'实体名称字体','Entypo'=>'Entypo','Equal group'=>'等价组','Equal right and left columns'=>'左右两栏等宽','Equals'=>'等于','Error 404'=>'错误 404','Error creating custom label'=>'创建自定义标签时出错','Error message'=>'错误信息','Estimate delivery'=>'预计送达时间','Estimate delivery on cart page'=>'在购物车页面预估送达时间','Estimated delivery'=>'预计送达时间','Estimated delivery dates'=>'预计送达日期','Even product grid'=>'均匀的产品网格','Even product grid for desktop'=>'适用于桌面的产品网格布局','Even product grid for mobile'=>'适用于移动端的均匀产品网格','Even product grid for tablet'=>'适用于平板电脑的均匀产品网格','Every 15 Minutes'=>'每15分钟','Everything is ready!'=>'一切都准备就绪了！','Example: \'thumbnail\', \'medium\', \'large\', \'full\' or enter image size in pixels: \'200x100\'.'=>'示例：“thumbnail”、“medium”、“large”、“full”，或以像素为单位输入图片尺寸：“200x100”。','Examp