ill not be able to post a review without selecting a criterion.'=>'如果勾选此选项，用户在未选择评分标准的情况下将无法发布评论。','If enabled you need to create maintenance page in Dashboard - Pages - Add new. Choose "Template" to be "Maintenance" in "Page attributes". Or you can import the page from our demo in "Prebuilt websites" page'=>'如果启用了此功能，您需要在“仪表盘”→“页面”→“添加新页面”中创建维护页面。在“页面属性”中，将“模板”设置为“维护”。或者，您也可以在“预建网站”页面中从我们的演示站点导入该页面。','If enabled, free gifts will not be added if there is at least one product in the cart that matches any exclude rule — even if some products match include rules.'=>'如果启用此功能，当购物车中至少有一件商品符合任何排除规则时，将不会添加赠品——即使有些商品符合包含规则。','If enabled, the user can add the same product to the cart multiple times. It works if the "Manual Gifts" rule is selected for the gift.'=>'如果启用此功能，用户可以将同一件商品多次添加到购物车中。只有当为该礼品选择了“手动礼品”规则时，此功能才有效。','If more than one wishlist'=>'如果有多个愿望清单','If the category you visit doesn\'t contain any subcategories, the page title menu will display this category\'s neighbors categories.'=>'如果您访问的分类下没有子分类，页面标题菜单将显示该分类的相邻分类。','If this field is filled, a hint with the specified text will appear next to the notice of the current rule.'=>'如果填写了此字段，则当前规则的提示信息旁边会显示包含指定文本的提示。','If use "Sidebar" be sure that you have enabled it for the product page layout'=>'如果使用“侧边栏”，请确保已在产品页面布局中启用了该功能','If you apply any changes to your banner settings or content you might want to force the banner to all visitors who already closed it again. In this case, you just need to increase the banner version.'=>'如果您对横幅设置或内容进行了任何更改，可能需要将横幅强制显示给所有已关闭过该横幅的访客。在这种情况下，您只需增加横幅版本号即可。','If you apply any changes to your popup settings or content you might want to force the popup to all visitors who already closed it again. In this case, you just need to increase the banner version.'=>'如果您对弹窗设置或内容进行了任何更改，可能需要强制向所有已关闭该弹窗的访客再次显示该弹窗。在这种情况下，您只需增加横幅版本号即可。','If you are not using default Gutenberg blocks you will not need these files to be loaded.'=>'如果您未使用默认的古腾堡（Gutenberg）区块，则无需加载这些文件。','If you are using multiple popups elements, be sure that all elements have unique IDs values.'=>'如果您使用了多个弹出窗口元素，请确保所有元素的 ID 值都是唯一的。','If you are using our header builder for your header configuration you can select different layout from the list for this particular page.'=>'如果您正在使用我们的页眉生成器来配置页眉，则可以从列表中为该特定页面选择不同的布局。','If you change your cookie policy information you can increase their version to show the popup to all visitors again.'=>'如果您修改了 Cookie 政策信息，可以将版本号提高，以便再次向所有访客显示该弹窗。','If you check this box, you are giving us permission to save some of your details into a contact list. You may receive email messages containing information of commercial or promotional nature concerning this store.
