','If you disable this option, when user click on the product on mobile devices, it will see its description text and add to cart button. The product page will be opened on second click.'=>'如果禁用此选项，当用户在移动设备上点击商品时，将看到商品描述文本和“加入购物车”按钮。点击第二次时，才会打开商品详情页。','If you don\'t want to receive any further notification, please'=>'如果您不想再收到任何通知，请','If you don\'t want to receive any further notification, please %s'=>'如果您不想再收到任何通知，请 %s','If you don\'t want to receive any further notification, please follow this link'=>'如果您不想再接收任何通知，请点击此链接','If you enable this option the shop filters will be always opened on the shop page.'=>'如果启用此选项，商店页面上的筛选功能将始终处于打开状态。','If you enable this option, a new post type for sliders will be added to your Dashboard menu. You will be able to create sliders with page builder and place them on any page on your website.'=>'如果启用此选项，仪表盘菜单中将新增一个用于幻灯片的新文章类型。您可以使用页面构建器创建幻灯片，并将其放置在网站的任意页面上。','If you enable this option, the tab with the brand information will be called "About [Brand name]".'=>'如果启用此选项，显示品牌信息的标签页将命名为“关于 [品牌名称]”。','If you have a lot of widgets added to the sidebar your single product page layout may look inconsistent. Try to enable this option in this situation.'=>'如果侧边栏中添加了大量小工具，您的单个商品页面布局可能会显得不协调。遇到这种情况时，请尝试启用此选项。','If you have problems with import/export of the additional variations images data, you need to use "Variations products meta" method.'=>'如果您在导入/导出附加变体图片数据时遇到问题，则需要使用“变体产品元数据”方法。','If you plan to make changes to the theme’s source code, we recommend using a child theme instead of modifying the main theme’s HTML, CSS, or PHP files directly. This way, you can safely update the parent theme without losing your customizations. Use the button below to create and activate a child theme.'=>'如果您计划修改主题的源代码，我们建议使用子主题，而不是直接修改主主题的 HTML、CSS 或 PHP 文件。这样，您就可以在安全地更新父主题的同时，保留您的自定义设置。请点击下方的按钮来创建并激活子主题。','If you select “AND”, you will be allowed to select only one attribute. In case of “OR”, you will be able to select multiple values.'=>'如果您选择“AND”，则只能选择一个属性。如果是“OR”，则可以选择多个值。','If you set this option to "Excerpt" then you would be able to set a custom excerpt for each post or it will be cut from the post content. If you choose "Full content" then all content will be shown, or you can add the "Read more button" while editing the post and by doing this cut your excerpt length as you need.'=>'如果您将此选项设置为“摘要”，则可以为每篇帖子设置自定义摘要，否则系统将从帖子内容中自动截取摘要。 如果您选择“完整内容”，则将显示全部内容；或者，您可以在编辑文章时添加“阅读更多”按钮，通过这种方式根据需要控制摘要的长度。','If you turn on this option, the section with description will be sticky when you scroll the page. In case when the description is higher than images, the images section will be fixed instead.'=>'如果启用此选项，当您滚动页面时，包含描述的区域将保持固定。如果描述位于图片上方，则图片区域将保持固定。','If you use custom extra content you can disable default WooCommerce order details on the thank you page'=>'如果您使用了自定义的额外内容，可以在“感谢”页面上禁用 WooCommerce 的默认订单详情','If you visit category Man, for example, only man\'s subcategories will be shown in the page title like T-shirts, Coats, Shoes etc.'=>'例如，如果您访问“男装”分类，页面标题中只会显示男装的子分类，如T恤、外套、鞋子等。','If you want to show brand image on your product page select desired attribute here. Read more information in our <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs-topic/product-brands/" target="_blank">documentation</a>.'=>'如果您想在产品页面上展示品牌形象，请在此处选择所需的属性。更多信息请参阅我们的<a href="https://xtemos.com/docs-topic/product-brands/" target="_blank">文档</a>。','If you wish to style particular content element differently, then use this field to add a class name and then refer to it in your css file.'=>'如果您希望对特定内容元素应用不同的样式，请在此字段中添加一个类名，然后在您的 CSS 文件中引用该类名。','Image'=>'图片','Image alignment'=>'图像对齐','Image dimension'=>'图像尺寸','Image for page title'=>'页面标题图片','Image gallery'=>'图片库','Image gallery element'=>'图片库组件','Image gallery element photoswipe'=>'图片库组件 photoswipe','Image Height'=>'图片高度','Image Hotspot'=>'图片热点','Image is required.'=>'必须提供图片。','Image link'=>'图片链接','image optimization'=>'图片优化','Image or SVG'=>'图片或 SVG','Image overlay'=>'图像叠加','Image Position'=>'图像位置','Image Primary'=>'主图片','