ider items.'=>'设置您希望在滑块项目之间显示的间隔数值。','Set the items gap.'=>'设置项目间距。','Set the menu items text align.'=>'设置菜单项的文本对齐方式。','Set the minimum cart amount required for customers to qualify for a free gift, ensuring that the gift is only offered on purchases above a specified amount.'=>'设置顾客获得免费赠品的最低购物金额门槛，确保仅当购物金额超过指定金额时才提供该赠品。','Set the number of days until the coupon expires.'=>'设置优惠券到期前的天数。','Set the number of pixels users have to scroll down before popup opens'=>'设置用户需要向下滚动多少像素后弹出窗口才会打开','Set the number of seconds for the shopping cart widget to be displayed after adding to cart'=>'设置商品加入购物车后，购物车小部件显示的秒数','Set the value in megabytes. Currently your server allows you to upload files up to 64 MB.'=>'请以兆字节为单位设置该值。目前您的服务器允许上传的最大文件大小为 64 MB。','Set titles for posts, products, categories and projects.'=>'为文章、产品、分类和项目设置标题。','Set typography for titles (h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6).'=>'设置标题的排版样式（h1、h2、h3、h4、h5、h6）。','Set up basic typography'=>'设置基本排版','Set up the email notification that informs customers when a product they have been waiting for is back in stock.'=>'设置电子邮件通知，以便在客户期待的产品有货时及时通知他们。','Set widgets height in pixels.'=>'以像素为单位设置小部件的高度。','Set width of the promo popup in pixels.'=>'以像素为单位设置促销弹窗的宽度。','Set width of the quick view in pixels.'=>'以像素为单位设置快速查看的宽度。','Set your categories menu in Header builder -> Mobile -> Mobile menu element -> Show/Hide -> Choose menu'=>'在“页眉构建器”→“移动端”→“移动端菜单元素”→“显示/隐藏”中设置您的分类菜单，然后选择菜单','Set your custom link for button or allow users to add some product to cart'=>'为按钮设置自定义链接，或允许用户将商品加入购物车','Set your default header for all pages from the list of all headers created with our Header builder.'=>'从使用我们的页眉生成器创建的所有页眉列表中，为所有页面设置默认页眉。','Set your thumbnails display or leave default set from Theme Settings.'=>'在“主题设置”中设置缩略图显示方式，或保留默认设置。','Sets how often the action repeats to send a batch of emails. You can choose the time gap between each send.'=>'设置发送一批电子邮件的操作重复频率。您可以选择每次发送之间的时间间隔。','Sets the maximum total size of CSS that can be inlined instead of loaded as