con'=>'带图标的文本','Text with subtotal'=>'包含小计的文本','Text/HTML'=>'文本/HTML','Text/HTML content'=>'文本/HTML内容','Thank you for activating the theme. After activation, you will be able to receive automatic updates via'=>'感谢您激活该主题。激活后，您将能够通过','Thank you for activation. Now you are able to get automatic updates for our theme via'=>'感谢您完成激活。现在，您可以通过以下方式获取我们主题的自动更新：','Thank you for being a valued part of our community!'=>'感谢您作为我们社区中宝贵的一员！','Thank you for choosing our theme!'=>'感谢您选择我们的主题！','Thank you for choosing WoodMart, our premium eCommerce theme! Get started building your stunning online store by easily importing one of our prebuilt demo sites and customizing the theme options to match your needs.'=>'感谢您选择 WoodMart——我们这款高端电商主题！您只需轻松导入我们预先搭建的演示站点之一，并根据您的需求自定义主题选项，即可开始打造您令人惊艳的网店。','Thank you for requesting to join the waitlist for this item:'=>'感谢您申请加入该商品的候补名单：','Thank you for requesting to join the waitlist for this item:
