','Thank you page'=>'感谢页面','The API server can\'t be reached. Please, contact your hosting provider to check the connectivity with our xtemos.com server. If you need further help, please, contact our support center too.'=>'无法连接到 API 服务器。请联系您的主机服务商，检查与我们 xtemos.com 服务器的连接情况。如果您需要进一步帮助，也请联系我们的支持中心。','The cart you\'re trying to recover has expired.'=>'您尝试恢复的购物车已过期。','The cart you\'re trying to recover is empty.'=>'您尝试恢复的购物车为空。','The desired price should not exceed the current price of the product.'=>'期望价格不应超过该产品的当前价格。','The file is not writable. Please try changing the file permissions on the server.'=>'该文件不可写。请尝试在服务器上更改文件权限。','The following option will not work if "Sticky header clone" is enabled in header settings.'=>'如果在页眉设置中启用了“固定页眉克隆”功能，则以下选项将无法生效。','The following plugin needs to be updated to its latest version to ensure maximum compatibility with this theme: %1$s.'=>'为了确保与该主题实现最佳兼容性，需要将以下插件更新至最新版本：%1$s。' . "\0" . '','The following recommended plugin is currently inactive: %1$s.'=>'以下推荐的插件目前处于非活动状态：%1$s。' . "\0" . '','The following required plugin is currently inactive: %1$s.'=>'以下必需的插件目前处于停用状态：%1$s。' . "\0" . '','The footer will be displayed behind the content of the page and will be visible when user scrolls to the bottom on the page.'=>'页脚将显示在页面内容的后面，当用户滚动到页面底部时即可看到。','The gift has already been added to the cart.'=>'该礼品已加入购物车。','The header builder cannot be loaded correctly. Probably, there is some JS conflict with some of the installed plugins or some issue with the header builder script. Check your JS console to debug this. Try to disable all external plugins and be sure that you have the latest version of the theme installed and then check again.'=>'无法正确加载页头生成器。这可能是由于其 JavaScript 与某些已安装的插件发生冲突，或者页头生成器脚本本身存在问题。请检查您的 JavaScript 控制台以进行调试。请尝试禁用所有外部插件，并确保已安装主题的最新版本，然后再次检查。','The header will be boxed instead of full width'=>'页眉将采用框式布局，而非全宽布局','The height for the banner area in pixels on desktop devices.'=>'桌面设备上横幅区域的高度（以像素为单位）。','The height for the banner area in pixels on mobile devices.'=>'移动设备上横幅区域的高度（以像素为单位）。','The height for the banner area in pixels on tablet devices.'=>'平板设备上横幅区域的高度（以像素为单位）。','The icon code from FontAwesome 5 list.'=>'来自 FontAwesome 5 列表的图标代码。','The ID of Navigation anchor.'=>'导航锚点的ID。','The image will be displayed in the term list in the additional information table'=>'该图片将显示在附加信息表中的术语列表中','The import process includes a homepage, products, posts, projects, images, and menus.'=>'导入过程包括主页、产品、文章、项目、图片和菜单。','The information from this portfolio will be used as an example while you are working with the portfolio template and Elementor.'=>'在使用作品集模板和 Elementor 进行操作时，本作品集中的信息将作为示例供您参考。','The information from this post will be used as an example while you are working with the post template and Elementor.'=>'在您使用文章模板和 Elementor 进行操作时，本篇文章中的信息将作为示例。','The information from this product will be used as an example while you work with the product template in the page builder.'=>'当您在页面构建器中使用产品模板时，将以此产品中的信息作为示例。','The license has been verified and the theme has been successfully activated. The automatic update feature is enabled.'=>'许可证已通过验证，主题已成功激活。自动更新功能已启用。','The link will be added to the whole banner area.'=>'该链接将被添加到整个横幅区域中。','The maximum file size is %s and you can upload up to %s images.'=>'单个文件的最大大小为 %s，最多可上传 %s 张图片。','The maximum number of posts to show'=>'要显示的帖子最大数量','The maximum upload file size: %s.'=>'最大上传文件大小：%s。','The minimum value must be less than the maximum value!'=>'最小值必须小于最大值！','The mobile header may have a different layout compared to the desktop version. Ensure that all important elements, such as navigation, icons, and menus, are properly arranged for mobile view. Click "Next" to continue.'=>'移动端页眉的布局可能与桌面版有所不同。请确保所有重要元素（如导航、图标和菜单）在移动端视图中排列得当。点击“下一步”继续。','The number of posts to skip'=>'要跳过的帖子数量','The option allows you to display the expected delivery date for orders. When this option is enabled, customers can see the estimated delivery dates.'=>'此选项可让您显示订单的预计送达日期。启用此选项后，客户即可查看预计送达日期。','The options below do not apply to custom product layouts, as they are managed via each layout’s individual settings.'=>'以下选项不适用于自定义产品布局，因为这些布局是通过各自的设置进行管理的。','The patch is already applied.'=>'该补丁已应用。','The pioneer multi-vendor plugin for WordPress. Start your own marketplace in minutes!'=>'WordPress 首款多供应商插件。只需几分钟，即可创建您自己的市场！','The price of some of the products you were watching has dropped.'=>'您曾关注的部分商品价格已下调。','The price will be reduced to'=>'价格将降至','The primary color is used for buttons, active elements, and highlights across your site. Try clicking the color picker to change this color.'=>'主色用于网站中的按钮、交互元素和突出显示部分。请点击颜色选择器来更改此颜色。','The product on your wishlist is back in stock!'=>'您愿望清单中的商品已补货！','The purchase code is invalid. <a target="_blank" href="https://help.market.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/202822600-Where-Is-My-Purchase-Code-">Where can I get my purchase code?</a>'=>'购买代码无效。<a target="_blank" href="https://help.market.envato.com/hc/en-us/articles/202822600-Where-Is-My-Purchase-Code-">在哪里可以获取购买代码？</a>','The secondary color is used for secondary accents and complementary elements that may contrast with the primary color. Try clicking the color picker to change this color.'=>'辅助色用于次要的点缀和与主色形成对比的补充元素。请点击颜色选择器来更改此颜色。','The sidebar will display the settings for the title element, including options for style, color, design, appearance, positioning, and more. Adjust these settings as needed, and once you\'re satisfied, click "Next" to proceed.'=>'侧边栏将显示标题元素的设置，包括样式、颜色、设计、外观、定位等选项。根据需要调整这些设置，满意后点击“下一步”继续。','The start date cannot be later than the end date. Please check the order of the entered dates.'=>'开始日期不能晚于结束日期。请检查所输入日期的顺序。','The text must be wrapped with the <u></u> tag to highlight it.'=>'要突出显示该文本，必须将其包裹在 <u></u> 标签中。','The token provided does not match the current user; make sure to log in with the right account'=>'提供的令牌与当前用户不匹配；请确保使用正确的账户登录','The token provided is expired; contact us to so we can manually unsubscribe your from the list'=>'您提供的令牌已过期；请联系我们，以便我们手动将您从列表中移除','The total number of products to display.'=>'要显示的产品总数。','The width of the element will depend on its content'=>'该元素的宽度取决于其内容','The WooCommerce Extra Product Options (WooCommerce Product Addons) plugin lets you add custom product fields(19 field types) and sections to your product page, making your WooCommerce product page more functional.'=>'WooCommerce 额外产品选项（WooCommerce 产品附加组件）插件可让您在产品页面中添加自定义产品字段（19 种字段类型）和板块，从而使您的 WooCommerce 产品页面功能更强大。','The World\'s Leading WordPress Website Builder'=>'全球领先的 WordPress 网站建设工具','Theme admin bar menu'=>'主题管理栏菜单','Theme Animation'=>'主题动画','Theme Animation Delay (ms)'=>'主题动画延迟（毫秒）','Theme Animation duration'=>'主题动画时长','Theme Animations'=>'主题动画','Theme elements'=>'主题元素','Theme fonts'=>'主题字体','Theme License'=>'主题许可','Theme license'=>'主题许可','Theme license is successfully deactivated.'=>'主题许可证已成功停用。','Theme license page'=>'主题许可页面','Theme Name'=>'主题名称','Theme name'=>'主题名称','Theme plugins'=>'主题插件','Theme settings'=>'主题设置','Theme settings backup'=>'主题设置备份','Theme settings hints'=>'主题设置提示','Theme settings presets'=>'主题设置预设','Theme style'=>'主题样式','Theme Version'=>'主题版本','ThemeForest Premium Theme'=>'ThemeForest 高级主题','There are currently no existing backups.'=>'目前没有现有的备份。','There are currently no existing presets.'=>'目前尚无现成的预设。','There are no patches found for your theme version.'=>'未找到与您的主题版本匹配的补丁。','There are no reviews matching the given conditions.'=>'没有符合所给条件的评论。','There are no slides yet.'=>'目前还没有幻灯片。','There is a deal for you!'=>'这里有一份专为您准备的优惠！','There is already a maximum number of gifts in the cart.'=>'购物车中的礼品数量已达到上限。','There is no product.'=>'没有该产品。','These attributes will be used to connect selected products with each other.'=>'这些属性将用于将选定产品相互关联。','These files will be updated:'=>'以下文件将进行更新：','These section are organized by purpose:'=>'这些部分按用途进行分类：','Thin 100'=>'Thin 100','Third'=>'第三','This allows you to view and edit the header directly in the live preview of your website, providing a more intuitive and accurate editing experience.'=>'这使您能够直接在网站的实时预览中查看和编辑页眉，从而提供更直观、更精准的编辑体验。','This button moves you to the top of the page when you click it.'=>'点击此按钮可将您带到页面顶部。','This categories menu is generated automatically based on all categories in the shop. You are not able to manage this menu as other WordPress menus.'=>'此分类菜单是根据商店中的所有分类自动生成的。您无法像管理其他 WordPress 菜单那样管理此菜单。','This element have not options'=>'该元素没有选项','This element is created for the compare page and you can find all its configuration in Theme Settings.'=>'该元素是为“对比”页面创建的，您可以在“主题设置”中查看其所有配置。','This element is created for the wishlist page and you can find all its configuration in Theme Settings.'=>'此组件专为“愿望清单”页面创建，您可以在“主题设置”中查看其所有配置。','This email confirms that the customer has successfully subscribed to price drop alerts for this product.'=>'本邮件确认该客户已成功订阅了该产品的降价提醒。','This email is already registered in the waitlist for this product.'=>'该邮箱已注册到该产品的候补名单中。','This email is sent to customers as a reminder to leave a review for their recent purchase.'=>'此电子邮件是发送给客户的，旨在提醒他们为最近的购买留下评价。','This email is sent to customers when an item of their wishlist is back in stock'=>'当客户“心愿单”中的商品有货时，系统会向其发送这封邮件','This email is sent to customers when an item of their wishlist is on sale'=>'当客户“心愿单”中的某件商品打折时，系统会向其发送这封邮件','This email is sent to customers when the price drops on products they are watching.'=>'当客户关注的商品价格下降时，系统会向其发送这封电子邮件。','This email is sent to the customer that has a product on his wishlist. You can send these emails via Dashboard -> Products -> Wishlists -> Popular products -> Create promotion.'=>'这封邮件将发送给将某款产品加入愿望清单的客户。您可以通过“仪表盘”→“产品”→“愿望清单”→“热门产品”→“创建促销活动”来发送此类邮件。','This email reminds customers about their incomplete purchases, encouraging them to complete their orders.'=>'这封电子邮件旨在提醒客户其未完成的购买，并鼓励他们完成订单。','This feature allows you to create a new kind of variable product based on simple products. You can create linked variations bundles via Dashboard -> Products -> Linked variations. Read more information in our <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs-topic/linked-variations/" target="_blank">documentation</a>.'=>'此功能允许您基于简易商品创建一种新型的可变商品。您可以通过“仪表盘”→“商品”→“关联变体”来创建关联变体组合。 更多信息请参阅我们的 <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs-topic/linked-variations/" target="_blank">文档</a>。','This field lets you modify the email subject line. Leave blank to use the default subject: <code>%s</code>.'=>'在此字段中，您可以修改电子邮件的主题行。若留空，则使用默认主题：<code>%s</code>。','This field lets you modify the main content of the HTML email. You can use the following placeholders: %1$s. Next placeholders you must use only within %2$s tags: %3$s'=>'此字段可用于修改 HTML 邮件的主体内容。您可以使用以下占位符：%1$s。以下占位符必须仅在 %2$s 标签内使用：%3$s','This field lets you modify the main content of the text email. You can use the following placeholders: %1$s. Next placeholders you must use only within %2$s tags: %3$s'=>'在此字段中，您可以修改文本邮件的主体内容。您可以使用以下占位符：%1$s。以下占位符必须仅在 %2$s 标签内使用：%3$s','This field lets you modify the main heading contained within the email notification. Leave blank to use the default heading: <code>%s</code>.'=>'此字段可用于修改电子邮件通知中的主标题。若留空，则使用默认标题：<code>%s</code>。','This icon will be used in areas such as the category menu in shop the page title and in category elements with the “navigation” type selected.'=>'该图标将用于“商店”页面中的分类菜单、页面标题以及选中了“导航”类型的分类元素等位置。','This icon will be used in areas such as the header menu, mobile menu, sticky menu, and category search results.'=>'该图标将用于页眉菜单、移动端菜单、固定菜单以及分类搜索结果等区域。','This image will be used as the background of the shop page title when viewing this category.'=>'浏览此分类时，该图片将用作店铺页面标题的背景。','This is somewhat embarrassing, isn&rsquo;t it?'=>'这有点尴尬，不是吗？','This is the first slide'=>'这是第一张幻灯片','This is the Header Builder panel, where you can add, delete, or import headers. Click "Next" to continue.'=>'这是“页眉设计器”面板，您可以在这里添加、删除或导入页眉。点击“下一步”继续。','This is the homepage of your website. It displays the content that visitors see first, including banners, titles, and key sections.'=>'这是您网站的首页。它显示的是访客首先看到的内容，包括横幅、标题和主要版块。','This is the last slide'=>'这是最后一页幻灯片','This is the LCP image detected on the page. Would you like to save it for preloading?'=>'这是在该页面上检测到的 LCP 图片。您是否要将其保存以便预加载？','This is where all visual customization begins.'=>'所有视觉自定义功能都从这里开始。','This is where you create new menus, edit existing ones, and assign them to different locations on your site.'=>'在这里，您可以创建新菜单、编辑现有菜单，并将它们分配到网站上的不同位置。','This is your website "Section title" element. Hover over it and click the "Pencil" icon to continue.'=>'这是您网站中的“章节标题”元素。将鼠标悬停在其上，然后点击“铅笔”图标继续操作。','This is your website logo element in the desktop header. Hover over it and click the "Pencil" icon to continue.'=>'这是您网站桌面版页眉中的徽标元素。将鼠标悬停在其上，然后点击“铅笔”图标继续。','This is your website logo element in the mobile header. Hover over it and click the "Pencil" icon to continue.'=>'这是您网站在移动端页眉中的徽标元素。将鼠标悬停在其上，然后点击“铅笔”图标继续操作。','This label is displayed for products if you enabled this option for particular items.'=>'如果您为特定商品启用了此选项，该标签就会显示在相应商品上。','This message will be displayed when the visitor don\'t verify his age.'=>'当访客未验证其年龄时，将显示此消息。','This option allows you to init carousel script only when visitor scroll the page to the slider. Useful for performance optimization.'=>'此选项允许您仅在访客将页面滚动到幻灯片区域时初始化轮播脚本。这有助于优化性能。','This option doesn\'t affect anything. It just shows/hides all scripts configuration. Note that we don\'t recommend you enable/disable any scripts if you are not sure how they work.'=>'此选项不会产生任何影响。它只是用于显示或隐藏所有脚本的配置。请注意，如果您不确定这些脚本的工作原理，我们不建议您启用或禁用任何脚本。','This option is deprecated. You can now use "Custom tabs" to add an unlimited number of tabs with different display conditions.'=>'此选项已弃用。现在您可以使用“自定义标签页”功能，添加数量不限且具有不同显示条件的标签页。','This option is deprecated. You can now use "Layouts" or "Theme settings presets" to change one or several individual product pages.'=>'此选项已弃用。现在，您可以使用“布局”或“主题设置预设”来修改一个或多个单独的产品页面。','This option is deprecated. You can use the "Width" option by selecting "Inline (auto)" to achieve the same result.'=>'此选项已弃用。您可以通过选择“内联（自动）”来使用“宽度”选项，以达到相同的效果。','This option will prevent filters area from closing when you click on certain filter links.'=>'此选项可防止在点击某些筛选器链接时，筛选器区域关闭。','This option will remove attribute loading=“lazy” from all images on your website.'=>'此选项将从您网站上的所有图片中移除“loading=“lazy””属性。','This option will replace standard WordPress gallery with “Justified gallery” JS library.'=>'此选项将用“Justified gallery”JS库替换标准的WordPress图库。','This option works with WooCommerce query Data source only. They are dedicated to the shop page layout.'=>'此选项仅适用于 WooCommerce 查询数据源。这些选项专用于商店页面的布局。','This options controls the typography for all heading elements on your site, such as h1–h6 tags. You can modify several controls: font family, font weight, font subset, font size, and color. Choose values that fit your site’s visual hierarchy. Then, click "Next" to proceed.'=>'此选项用于控制网站上所有标题元素（如 h1–h6 标签）的排版样式。您可以修改以下设置：字体家族、字重、字体子集、字号和颜色。请选择符合您网站视觉层次结构的数值。然后，点击“下一步”继续。','This options defines the default typography for your site’s body text, including paragraphs and general content. You’ll find several key controls here: font family, font weight, font subset, font size and color. Review and change these settings as needed. When you’re done, click "Next" to continue.'=>'此选项用于定义网站正文文本（包括段落和常规内容）的默认排版样式。此处包含几个关键控制项：字体家族、字重、字体子集、字号和颜色。请根据需要查看并修改这些设置。完成后，点击“下一步”继续。','This order was created using the abandoned cart recovery feature. The customer received a reminder email and successfully recovered their cart.'=>'该订单是通过“abandoned cart recovery”功能生成的。客户收到了提醒邮件，并成功恢复了购物车。','This panel allows you to modify most aspects of your site’s appearance.'=>'通过此面板，您可以修改网站外观的大部分方面。','This panel contains the settings for the current header. You can change the color, size, block arrangement, or add new elements. Click "Next" to continue.'=>'此面板包含当前页眉的设置。您可以更改颜色、大小、模块布局，或添加新元素。点击“下一步”继续。','This post belongs to the following categories'=>'本文属于以下分类','This product is currently sold out.'=>'该产品目前已售罄。','This product type is not allowed for the waitlist.'=>'此类产品不支持候补名单。','This section contains all the global 