此时，页面中必须存在一个 ID 为“section-id”的章节，点击该按钮后，页面将平滑滚动至该章节。','When you turn on this option you need to specify this button link with a hash symbol. For example #section-id Then you need to have a section with an ID of "section-id" and this button click will smoothly scroll the page to that section.'=>'启用此选项后，您需要使用井号（#）来指定该按钮的链接。例如：#section-id。此时，页面中必须存在一个 ID 为“section-id”的章节，点击该按钮后，页面将平滑滚动至该章节。','When you will select any variation, the price on the single product page will be updated with an actual variation price.'=>'当您选择任何一种变体时，单个商品页面的价格将更新为该变体的实际价格。','Where is my code?'=>'我的代码在哪里？','White'=>'白色','White label'=>'品牌化配置','white space'=>'空白','Wide'=>'宽','Wide (1600 px)'=>'宽版（1600 像素）','Widget Area for full screen menu'=>'全屏菜单的小部件区域','Widget Area for My Account, orders and other user pages.'=>'用于“我的账户”、订单及其他用户页面的小工具区域。','Widget Area for shop filters above the products'=>'位于商品上方、用于商店筛选功能的小工具区域','Widget Area for shop pages'=>'商店页面的小工具区域','Widget Area for single product page'=>'单个产品页面的小工具区域','widget bar'=>'小工具栏','Widget for author information'=>'作者信息小工具','Widget settings'=>'小工具设置','Widget title'=>'小部件标题','Widget title tag'=>'小部件标题标签','Widget title toggle'=>'小部件标题切换','Widget titles font'=>'小部件标题字体','Widgets'=>'小工具','Widgets added to the footer will be collapsed by default and opened when you click on their titles.'=>'添加到页脚的小工具默认处于折叠状态，点击其标题即可展开。','Widgets collapse script'=>'小工具折叠脚本','Width'=>'宽度','Will be executed on $(document).ready()'=>'将在 $(document).ready() 时执行','Wishlist'=>'愿望清单','Wishlist content'=>'愿望清单内容','Wishlist count'=>'愿望清单数量','Wishlist group'=>'愿望清单组','Wishlist icon'=>'愿望清单图标','Wishlist is available only for logged in visitors.'=>'“愿望清单”功能仅对已登录的访客开放。','Wishlist page'=>'愿望清单页面','Wishlist products'=>'愿望清单中的商品','Wishlist promotional email is currently disabled. You need to enable it if you want to send promotional emails to your customers. Find it in'=>'“愿望清单”促销邮件功能目前已禁用。如果您想向客户发送促销邮件，需要先启用该功能。请在以下位置查找：','Wishlist: on sale item'=>'心愿单：特价商品','Wishlist: product back in