return 200'=>'X 没有返回 200','X link'=>'X 链接','X Name (without @ symbol)'=>'X 姓名（不带 @ 符号）','X Name (without @ symbol):'=>'X 姓名（不带 @ 符号）：','X Position'=>'X 位置','X social link'=>'X 社交链接','XL'=>'XL','XS'=>'XS','XTemos'=>'XTemos','Xtemos'=>'Xtemos','XXL'=>'XXL','XXL (36px)'=>'XXL（36像素）','XXXL (46px)'=>'XXXL（46px）','xxxxxxxxxxxx'=>'xxxxxxxxxxxx','Y axis translation'=>'Y轴平移','Y Position'=>'Y 位置','yearly archives date formatY'=>'Y','Yearly Archives: '=>'年度归档：','Yellow'=>'黄色','Yelp'=>'Yelp','Yelp link'=>'Yelp 链接','Yelp social link'=>'Yelp 社交链接','Yes'=>'是','yes'=>'是','Yoast'=>'Yoast','Yoast breadcrumbs for pages'=>'Yoast 页面面包屑导航','Yoast breadcrumbs for shop'=>'Yoast 商店面包屑导航','You already have the same desired price for this product.'=>'您已经为该商品设置了相同的期望价格。','You are allowed to upload images only in %s formats.'=>'您只能上传%s格式的图片。','You are allowed to use our theme only on one domain if you purchased a regular license. But we give you an ability to activate our theme to turn on auto updates on two domains: for the development website and for your production (live) website.'=>'如果您购买的是标准许可证，则仅允许在一个域名上使用我们的主题。但我们为您提供了在两个域名上激活主题以开启自动更新的功能：一个用于开发网站，另一个用于您的生产（正式）网站。','You are not allowed to recover this cart.'=>'您无权取回此购物车。','You are now in the WordPress block editor. Here, you can manage the layout and content of your page using blocks such as headings, paragraphs, images, and more.'=>'您现在处于 WordPress 块编辑器中。在这里，您可以使用标题、段落、图片等块来管理页面的布局和内容。','You are now in the WordPress page editor. When using Elementor, this page serves as a transitional screen between WordPress and the Elementor editor. Click "Next" to proceed.'=>'您现在位于 WordPress 页面编辑器中。使用 Elementor 时，此页面作为 WordPress 与 Elementor 编辑器之间的过渡界面。点击“下一步”继续。','You are now in the WordPress page editor. When using WPBakery, this page serves as a transitional screen between WordPress and the WPBakery editor. Click "Next" to proceed.'=>'您现在位于 WordPress 页面编辑器中。使用 WPBakery 时，此页面作为 WordPress 与 WPBakery 编辑器之间的过渡界面。点击“下一步”继续。','You are now inside the WPBakery Page Builder editor. Here, you can visually manage your page content using rows, columns, and content elements.'=>'您现在已进入 WPBakery 页面构建器编辑器。在这里，您可以通过行、列和内容元素以可视化方式管理页面内容。','You can add some member bio here.'=>'您可以在这里添加一些成员简介。','You can change default products category description position and move it below the products.'=>'您可以更改默认产品分类描述的位置，将其移至产品下方。','You can change menu style in the header.'=>'您可以在页眉中更改菜单样式。','You can choose between two types of sticky header effects.'=>'您可以从两种固定页眉效果中进行选择。','You can choose different page layout depending on the product image size you need'=>'您可以根据所需的产品图片尺寸选择不同的页面布局','You can choose different page layout depending on the product image size you need.'=>'您可以根据所需的产品图片尺寸选择不同的页面布局。','You can choose how many pages the user should visit before the popup will be shown.'=>'您可以选择用户需要浏览多少页后才会显示弹出窗口。','You can clean all default WooCommerce PHP functions hooked to this action.'=>'您可以清理所有挂接到此操作上的默认 WooCommerce PHP 函数。','You can configure your bundles in Dashboard -> Products -> Frequently Bought Together. Read more information in our <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs-topic/frequently-bought-together/" target="_blank">documentation</a>.'=>'您可以在“仪表盘”→“产品”→“常一起购买”中配置您的捆绑包。更多信息请参阅我们的<a href="https://xtemos.com/docs-topic/frequently-bought-together/" target="_blank">文档</a>。','You can configure your checkout forms in Dashboard -> WooCommerce -> Checkout Fields.'=>'您可以在“仪表盘”→“WooCommerce”→“结账字段”中配置结账表单。','You can configure your discounts in Dashboard -> Products -> Dynamic Discounts.'=>'您可以在“仪表盘”→“产品”→“动态折扣”中配置折扣。','You can create a separate content that will be displayed on mobile devices to optimize the performance.'=>'您可以创建专门针对移动设备显示的内容，以优化性能。','You can create an HTML Block in Dashboard -> HTML Blocks and add Product filters page builder element there.'=>'您可以在“仪表盘”→“HTML 块”中创建一个 HTML 块，并在其中添加“产品筛选器”页面构建器组件。','You can create some extra content with page builder (in Admin panel / HTML Blocks / Add new) and add it to this product'=>'您可以使用页面构建器（在管理面板 / HTML 块 / 添加新内容）创建一些额外内容，并将其添加到该产品中','You can create your page layout with an off-canvas sidebar. In this case, you need to have two columns: one will be set as the off-canvas sidebar and another as the content. NOTE: you need to also display the Off-canvas button element somewhere in your content column to open the sidebar. Also, you need to enable them on specific devices synchronously.'=>'您可以使用离屏侧边栏来设计页面布局。在这种情况下，您需要设置两个栏目：一个作为离屏侧边栏，另一个作为内容区。 注意：您还需要在内容栏的某个位置显示“画外”按钮元素，以便打开侧边栏。此外，您需要在特定设备上同步启用这些功能。','You can crop the original image size to any custom size. You can also set a single value for height or width in order to keep the original size ratio.'=>'您可以将原始图片裁剪为任意自定义尺寸。您还可以仅设置高度或宽度中的一个数值，以保持原始图片的宽高比。','You can disable this option on mobile devices completely.'=>'您可以在移动设备上完全禁用此选项。','You can disable/enable product\'s brand image on the single page.'=>'您可以在商品详情页上禁用/启用商品的品牌图片。','You can display any product or custom text in the hotspot content.'=>'您可以在热区内容中显示任何产品或自定义文本。','You can display attributes table after of short description.'=>'您可以在简要描述之后显示属性表。','You can display content as a simple text or if you need more complex structure you can create an HTML Block with Elementor builder and place it here.'=>'您可以将内容以纯文本形式显示；如果需要更复杂的结构，可以使用 Elementor 构建器创建一个 HTML 块，并将其放置在此处。','You can display icon based on image or just write some text like 01., 02., M, X etc.'=>'您可以根据图片显示图标，或者直接输入一些文本，例如 01.、02.、M、X 等。','You can display some products, posts, banners or other information in the header search area. To display extra content in the search, a special option needs to be enabled in the corresponding search element.'=>'您可以在页眉搜索区域显示一些产品、文章、横幅或其他信息。若要在搜索区域显示额外内容，需要在相应的搜索组件中启用一个特殊选项。','You can enable login with Google on your web-site.
			To do that you need to Create a Google APIs project at <a href="https://console.cloud.google.com/home/dashboard" target="_blank">https://console.developers.google.com/apis/dashboard/</a>.
			Make sure to go to API Access tab and Create an OAuth 2.0 client ID. Choose Web application for Application type. Make sure that redirect URI is set to actual OAuth 2.0 callback URL, usually <strong>{{PERMALINK}}google/oauth2callback </strong> More information you can get in our <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs/woodmart/faq-guides/configure-google-login/" target="_blank">documentation</a>.'=>'您可以在您的网站上启用 Google 登录功能。
			为此，您需要在 <a href="https://console.cloud.google.com/home/dashboard" target="_blank">https://console.developers.google.com/apis/dashboard/</a> 创建一个 Google APIs 项目。
			请务必转到“API 访问”选项卡，并创建一个 OAuth 2.0 客户端 ID。 在“应用类型”中选择“Web 应用”。请确保重定向 URI 设置为实际的 OAuth 2.0 回调 URL，通常为 <strong>{{PERMALINK}}google/oauth2callback </strong> 更多信息，请参阅我们的 <a href="https://xtemos.com/docs/woodmart/faq-guides/configure-google-login/" target="_blank">文档</a>中获取更多信息。','You can enable this option to show the "Browse wishlist" button when you visit the product that has been already added to the wishlist.  IMPORTANT: It will not work if you use some full-page cache like WP Rocket or WP Total Cache.'=>'您可以启用此选项，以便在访问已添加到愿望清单中的商品页面时显示“浏览愿望清单”按钮。 重要提示：如果您使用了 WP Rocket 或 WP Total Cache 等全页面缓存插件，此功能将无法正常工作。','You can enable/disable this option globally. If you want to load them on the particular page only, you can create a special Theme Settings preset for this and add a condition for that page.'=>'您可以全局启用或禁用此选项。如果您只想在特定页面上加载这些内容，可以为此创建一个专门的“主题设置”预设，并为该页面添加相应条件。','You can find more Open Street Maps styles on the website: %1$s OpenStreetMap Wiki %2$s %3$s Just copy url and paste it here %3$s For example: %4$s'=>'您可以在以下网站上找到更多 OpenStreetMap 样式：%1$s OpenStreetMap 维基 %2$s %3$s 只需复制网址并粘贴到此处 %3$s 例如：%4$s','You can find more Open Street Maps styles on the website: %1$s OpenStreetMap Wiki %2$s Just copy url and paste it here. For example: %4$s'=>'您可以在以下网站上找到更多 OpenStreetMap 样式：%1$s OpenStreetMap Wiki %2$s 只需复制网址并粘贴到此处即可。例如：%4$s','You can force Font Awesome library to be loaded on all pages. This option works only if Elementor or WPBakery is active.'=>'您可以强制在所有页面上加载 Font Awesome 库。此选项仅在 Elementor 或 WPBakery 处于激活状态时有效。','You can hide all "Add to cart" buttons, cart widget, cart and checkout pages. This will allow you to showcase your products as an online catalog without ability to make a purchase.'=>'您可以隐藏所有“加入购物车”按钮、购物车小工具、购物车页面和结账页面。这样，您就可以将产品作为在线产品目录进行展示，而不会提供购买功能。','You can hide related products on this page'=>'您可以隐藏此页面上的相关产品','You can hide the sidebar from the page and show it nicely with a button click.'=>'您可以将侧边栏从页面中隐藏，并通过点击按钮将其美观地显示出来。','You can hide the sidebar on desktop and show it nicely with a button click.'=>'您可以在桌面端隐藏侧边栏，并通过点击按钮将其美观地显示出来。','You can hide the sidebar on mobile devices and show it nicely with a button click.'=>'您可以在移动设备上隐藏侧边栏，并通过点击按钮将其美观地显示出来。','You can hide the sidebar on tablet and show it nicely with a button click.'=>'您可以在平板电脑上隐藏侧边栏，并通过点击按钮将其美观地显示出来。','You can hide the sidebar on tablet devices and show it nicely with a button click.'=>'您可以在平板设备上隐藏侧边栏，并通过点击按钮将其美观地显示出来。','You can leave this option for desktop only or enable it for all devices sizes.'=>'您可以将此选项仅限于桌面端，或将其启用以适配所有设备尺寸。','You can limit your Layered Navigation widgets by height and enable nice scroll for them. Useful if you have a lot of product colors/sizes or other attributes for filters.'=>'您可以根据高度限制分层导航小部件的大小，并为其启用平滑滚动功能。如果您的产品有大量颜色、尺码或其他筛选属性，此功能将非常实用。','You can make your content wrapper boxed, full width or set your custom width in pixels.'=>'您可以将内容容器设置为“盒装”样式、全宽，或者以像素为单位设置自定义宽度。','You can manually disable JS files from being loaded using their keys. Write their case separated with a comma. For example: woodmart-theme,elementor-frontend'=>'您可以通过键名手动禁用 JS 文件的加载。请用逗号分隔键名（区分大小写）。例如：woodmart-theme,elementor-frontend','You can manually load some initialization scripts on all pages.'=>'您可以在所有页面上手动加载一些初始化脚本。','You can manually load some styles on all pages.'=>'您可以手动在所有页面上加载某些样式。','You can manually unload some initialization scripts on all pages.'=>'您可以在所有页面上手动移除某些初始化脚本。','You can manually unload some styles on all pages.'=>'您可以手动在所有页面上移除某些样式。','You can pass a special GET parameter to suppress the maintenance mode. For example, https://website.com/?suppress_maintenance'=>'您可以传递一个特殊的 GET 参数来禁用维护模式。例如：https://website.com/?suppress_maintenance','You can reduce the number of DOM elements on mobile devices. This option currently removes all HTML tags from the desktop header version on mobile devices.'=>'您可以在移动设备上减少 DOM 元素的数量。此选项目前会在移动设备上移除桌面版页眉中的所有 HTML 标签。','You can restrict shopping functions only for logged in customers.'=>'您可以将购物功能仅限于已登录的客户使用。','You can rewrite mobile menu tab title with this option. Or leave empty to have a default one - Categories.'=>'您可以通过此选项重写移动端菜单标签的标题。或者留空以使用默认标题——“分类”。','You can rewrite mobile menu tab title with this option. Or leave empty to have a default one - Menu.'=>'您可以通过此选项重写移动端菜单标签的标题。或者留空以使用默认标题——“菜单”。','You can select a different header from the list for this particular product.'=>'您可以从列表中为该特定产品选择另一个标题。','You can set different sizes for your blog pages sidebar'=>'您可以为博客页面的侧边栏设置不同的尺寸','You can set different sizes for your page titles.'=>'您可以为页面标题设置不同的字号。','You can set different sizes for your pages sidebar'=>'您可以为页面的侧边栏设置不同的尺寸','You can set different sizes for your portfolio pages sidebar'=>'您可以为作品集页面的侧边栏设置不同的尺寸','You can set different sizes for your project pages sidebar'=>'您可以为项目页面的侧边栏设置不同的尺寸','You can set different sizes for your shop pages sidebar'=>'您可以为店铺页面的侧边栏设置不同的尺寸','You can set different sizes for your single product pages sidebar'=>'您可以为单个产品页面的侧边栏设置不同的尺寸','You can set different spacing between blocks on portfolio page'=>'您可以在作品集页面上设置不同模块之间的间距','You can set different spacing between grid products on shop page'=>'您可以在商店页面上设置网格商品之间的不同间距','You can set different spacing between grid products on shop page.'=>'您可以在商店页面上设置网格商品之间的不同间距。','You can set different spacing between list products on shop page'=>'您可以在商店页面上设置列表中各商品之间的不同间距','You can set different spacing between list products on shop page.'=>'您可以在商店页面上设置列表中各商品之间的不同间距。','You can set different view mode for the related products. These settings will be applied for upsells products as well.'=>'您可以为相关产品设置不同的显示模式。这些设置同样适用于追加销售产品。','You can set different view mode for the shop page'=>'您可以为商店页面设置不同的查看模式','You can set text different color depending on its background. It can be light or dark.'=>'您可以根据背景颜色设置文字的不同颜色，可以是浅色，也可以是深色。','You can set the different spacing between posts on the blog page.'=>'您可以在博客页面上设置文章之间的不同间距。','You can set your footer section background color or upload your image.'=>'您可以设置页脚区域的背景色，或上传图片。','You can show a real number of customers viewing the product or set a random fake number.'=>'您可以显示正在浏览该商品的真实客户数量，也可以设置一个随机的虚假数字。','You can show a real number of orders count for this product or set a random fake number.'=>'您可以显示该商品的实际订单数量，也可以设置一个随机的虚假数字。','You can show only variations on the shop page excluding the main parent product.'=>'您可以在店铺页面上仅显示变体，而不显示主父级商品。','You can specify "font-display" property for icon fonts used in our theme. Read more information <a href="https://developers.google.com/web/updates/2016/02/font-display">here</a>'=>'您可以为本主题中使用的图标字体指定“font-display”属性。更多信息请参阅 <a href="https://developers.google.com/web/updates/2016/02/font-display">此处</a>','You can specify "font-display" property for text fonts. Read more information <a href="https://developers.google.com/web/updates/2016/02/font-display">here</a>'=>'您可以为文本字体指定“font-display”属性。更多信息请参阅 <a href="https://developers.google.com/web/updates/2016/02/font-display">此处</a>','You can switch between links that will lead to project categories and masonry filters within one page only. Or turn off the filters completely.'=>'您可以在同一页面内，在指向项目分类的链接与马赛克式筛选器之间进行切换。或者完全关闭这些筛选器。','You can switch between share and follow buttons on the single product page.'=>'在单个商品页面上，您可以切换“分享”和“关注”按钮。','You can upload up to %s images to your review.'=>'您最多可向评论中上传 %s 张图片。','You can use <a href="https://universimmedia.pagesperso-orange.fr/geo/loc.htm" target="_blank">this service</a> to get coordinates of your location.'=>'您可以使用 <a href="https://universimmedia.pagesperso-orange.fr/geo/loc.htm" target="_blank">此服务</a> 来获取您所在位置的坐标。','You can use different design for your blog carousel'=>'您可以为博客轮播图选择不同的设计','You can use different design for your blog styled for the theme'=>'您可以根据主题风格为博客采用不同的设计','You can use different design for your single post page.'=>'您可以为单篇文章页面采用不同的设计。','You can use different design for your team member styled for the theme'=>'您可以根据主题风格，为团队成员设计不同的样式','You can use different header for your single portfolio page.'=>'您可以为单个作品集页面使用不同的页眉。','You can use different header for your single post page.'=>'您可以为单篇文章页面使用不同的页眉。','You can use different header for your single product page.'=>'您可以为单个商品页面使用不同的页眉。','You can use different style for your portfolio styled for the theme'=>'您可以根据主题风格，为作品集选择不同的样式','You can use different styles for your projects.'=>'您可以为项目采用不同的样式。','You can use flat style or add a background to your blog posts.'=>'您可以为博客文章采用扁平化风格，或添加背景。','You can use shortcodes. Ex.: [social_buttons] or place an HTML Block built with page builder there like [html_block id="258"]'=>'您可以使用短代码。例如：[social_buttons]，或者在此处插入一个使用页面构建器创建的 HTML 块，例如 [html_block id="258"]','You can use some of our predefined styles for your banner content.'=>'您可以为横幅内容使用我们预设的一些样式。','You can use widgets or custom HTML block with our Product filters page builder element.'=>'您可以使用小部件或自定义 HTML 块，配合我们的“产品筛选器”页面构建器组件进行操作。','You can write a list of popular requests in Theme Settings -> General -> Search'=>'您可以在“主题设置”→“常规”→“搜索”中编写一份热门搜索词列表。','You cannot deactivate the plugin on a multisite.'=>'在多站点环境中，您无法停用该插件。','You cannot register more than one email for one product.'=>'一个产品最多只能注册一个电子邮箱。','You do not have permission to perform this action.'=>'您无权执行此操作。','You don\'t have any products in the waiting list yet. Go to the shop and add out-of-stock items to your waitlist so you don\'t miss out when they\'re back in stock.'=>'您的等待列表中目前还没有任何商品。请前往商店，将缺货的商品添加到等待列表中，这样当它们有货时，您就不会错过。','You have successfully subscribed to price drop notifications.'=>'您已成功订阅价格下调提醒。','You have successfully unsubscribed from product review reminder emails'=>'您已成功取消订阅产品评论提醒邮件','You have to be logged in to be able to add photos to your review.'=>'您必须先登录，才能在评论中添加照片。','You have unsubscribed from our wishlist-related mailing lists'=>'您已退订了我们与愿望清单相关的邮件列表','You have unsubscribed from this product mailing list'=>'您已从该产品的邮件列表中退订','You have unsubscribed from this product mailing lists'=>'您已从该产品的邮件列表中退订','You must accept our Privacy Policy to join the Price tracker.'=>'您必须接受我们的《隐私政策》才能加入“价格追踪器”。','You must accept our Privacy Policy to join the waitlist.'=>'您必须同意我们的《隐私政策》才能加入候补名单。','You must agree to store your purchase code and user data by xtemos.com'=>'您必须同意由 xtemos.com 存储您的购买代码和用户数据','You must provide a valid email address to join the waitlist for this product.'=>'您必须提供一个有效的电子邮箱地址，才能加入该产品的候补名单。','You must select your brand attribute in Theme Settings -> Shop -> Brands'=>'您必须在“主题设置”→“商店”→“品牌”中选择您的品牌属性','You must specify the desired price for this product.'=>'您必须为该产品指定期望价格。','You need connect your Instagram account in Theme settings -> API integrations -> Connect instagram account'=>'您需要在“主题设置”→“API 集成”→“连接 Instagram 账户”中连接您的 Instagram 账户。','You need to create a form using Contact form 7 plugin to be able to display it using this element.'=>'您需要使用“Contact Form 7”插件创建一个表单，才能通过此元素显示该表单。','You need to create a form using MC4WP: Mailchimp for WordPress plugin to be able to display it using this element.'=>'您需要使用 MC4WP：Mailchimp for WordPress 插件创建一个表单，才能通过此元素显示该表单。','You need to create an empty page and select from the dropdown. It will be used as a root page for your portfolio archives.'=>'您需要创建一个空白页面，并从下拉菜单中进行选择。该页面将作为您的作品集归档的根页面。','You need to enable Elementor Flexbox Container feature in Elementor -> Settings -> Features to import our dummy content properly.'=>'您需要在 Elementor -> 设置 -> 功能 中启用 Elementor Flexbox 容器功能，才能正确导入我们的示例内容。','You need to enter your Consumer key and secret to display your recent X (Twitter) feed.'=>'您需要输入您的客户端密钥和密钥密文，才能显示您最近的 X（Twitter）动态。','You need to install the following plugins to use our import function: <strong><a href="%1$s">%2$s</a></strong>'=>'要使用我们的导入功能，您需要安装以下插件：<strong><a href="%1$s">%2$s</a></strong>','You need to resave variable products to make this option work. You can do this separately or using the bulk edit function.'=>'您需要重新保存可变产品，才能使此选项生效。您可以单独操作，也可以使用批量编辑功能。','You need to set an image as a featured image to be able to use it as an menu item image'=>'您需要将一张图片设置为特色图片，才能将其用作菜单项的图片','You need to upload an image for the parent element first.'=>'您需要先为父元素上传一张图片。','You need to upload your images manually to the element if you want to load them from your website. Otherwise you will need to connect your real Instagram account via API.'=>'如果您想从自己的网站加载图片，则需要手动将图片上传到该组件中。否则，您需要通过 API 连接您的真实 Instagram 账号。','You need WPML plugin for this to work. You can remove it from Header builder.'=>'要使此功能正常工作，您需要安装 WPML 插件。您可以将其从页头构建器中移除。','You not have access.'=>'您无权访问。','You will be notified when product is back in stock'=>'该商品有货时，您将收到通知','You will need to install and activate this <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/relevanssi/" target="_blank">plugin</a>'=>'您需要安装并激活此 <a href="https://wordpress.org/plugins/relevanssi/" target="_blank">插件</a>','You\'ve successfully updated the title element using WPBakery Page Builder. Click the "Done" button to finish.'=>'您已成功使用 WPBakery Page Builder 更新了标题元素。点击“完成”按钮以结束操作。','Your attribute labels will be displayed on the product image.'=>'您的属性标签将显示在产品图片上。','Your cart has been recovered successfully.'=>'您的购物车已成功恢复。','Your homepage title has been successfully updated – the changes are now live. Click the "Done" button to finish.'=>'您的主页标题已成功更新——更改现已生效。请点击“完成”按钮以结束操作。','Your honest feedback helps us improve and continue offering products you love. Plus, it helps fellow customers get a better idea of what to expect.'=>'您真诚的反馈有助于我们不断改进，并继续为您提供您喜爱的产品。此外，这还能帮助其他顾客更好地了解产品情况。','Your out of stock products will have a badge with "Sold out" label.'=>'缺货的商品上会显示一个标有“售罄”字样的标签。','Your price tracker is empty. Head over to the shop and start tracking items to stay updated on discounts.'=>'您的价格追踪列表为空。请前往商店，开始追踪商品，以便及时了解折扣信息。','Your products marked as "Featured" will have a badge with "Hot" label.'=>'您标记为“精选”的产品将显示带有“热门”标签的徽章。','Your products wishlist'=>'您的产品愿望清单','Your recent purchase:'=>'您最近的购买：','Your sale products will have a badge with "Sale" label.'=>'您的促销商品上将标有“促销”标签。','Your selection has been saved successfully.'=>'您的选择已成功保存。','Your subscription to price drop notifications is now active.'=>'您订阅的降价提醒现已生效。','Your waitlist subscription has been successfully confirmed.'=>'您的候补名单订阅已成功确认。','Your wishlists'=>'您的愿望清单','Your WordPress menu is now ready. You’ve successfully updated your menu, added items, configured settings, and saved it. Your changes are now live on your site. Click the "Done" button to finish.'=>'您的 WordPress 菜单现已准备就绪。您已成功更新菜单、添加项目、配置设置并保存了菜单。您的更改现已应用到网站上。点击“完成”按钮以结束操作。','YouTube'=>'YouTube','YouTube link'=>'YouTube 链接','YouTube social link'=>'YouTube 社交链接','YouTube video URL'=>'YouTube 视频网址','You’re already subscribed to price drop notifications for this product.'=>'您已订阅了该商品的价格下调提醒。','You’re now subscribed to price tracking for this product. We’ll notify you if the price drops.'=>'您现已订阅了该商品的价格跟踪服务。如果价格下降，我们会通知您。','You’ve been unsubscribed from price tracker emails for this product'=>'您已取消订阅该产品的价格追踪邮件','You’ve successfully customized your site’s styles and colors. Click the "Done" button to finish.'=>'您已成功自定义了网站的样式和颜色。点击“完成”按钮以结束操作。','You’ve successfully customized your site’s typography for text and headings. Click the "Done" button to finish.'=>'您已成功自定义了网站中正文和标题的字体样式。点击“完成”按钮即可结束操作。','Z axis translation'=>'Z轴平移','Z Index'=>'Z指数','Z-index'=>'Z-index','Zone: %1$s. Method: %2$s'=>'区域：%1$s。方法：%2$s','Zoom'=>'Zoom','Zoom control'=>'缩放控制','Zoom image'=>'放大图片','Zoom in'=>'放大','Zoom level when focus the marker 0 - 19'=>'将焦点移至标记时的缩放级别 0 - 19','Zoom level when focus the marker 1 - 20'=>'聚焦标记时的缩放级别 1 - 20','Zoom out'=>'缩小','Zoom reverse'=>'缩小','Zoom with mouse wheel'=>'使用鼠标滚轮缩放','— None —'=>'— 无 —','“Filters only” variant works with WoodMart Layered Navigation widgets.'=>'“仅筛选条件”变体可与 WoodMart 分层导航小部件配合使用。','“Verified owner” badge'=>'“已验证所有者”徽章']];
